Yatsug aidauh, ubag aidauh, tikich Jisukristu nemajin aidauk pegkegchaunmag chichagkaigpajum. Nuna nuniauk Apajuí chicham umiktajum tibauwa nunash pegkegchau chichajak nuniawai. Tuja chicham umiktajum tibauwa nu pegkegchauwai tusam umiachkumek, apu chichama epegna nunin wegame.
“Mina aentsug aidau jiintin ainayatak wainmachujai betek aina nunú, tuja kuishtinaitak antuchu aina nunú dita nugken ashí awakjatajum.
