Yabai niina aentsji
Makichik nuwauch emetnag pujuchujai betek wainka yujajum dusha ¿wajutiya idaisattagme? Witjai Tuke Pujuu, Israel aents aidau Apajuíjinuk, juju nugka juwi pegkejan Apajuí umike. Nunak nuwa aishin aneak ataktu wakitkittawai”, tawai.
“Tuja Aarón nuwi wayakug apeaku tudau tsagkugnagtinun toro tsakatan juki wayati, untsu mina anentag sujamun uwig tsakat aishmagkun juki waya, nuna apeak emematjiti.
Bakichik grupo piipichi aishmag aidaujai apatka diyamak
Amek pegkeg aina nu aneakum, pegkegchau aina duka dakitjaume. Nuaduí Apajuí, amina Apajuigmea nu shiig aneemtijamsae kumpajum aina nuna nagkaesau”, tiuwai.
