Kuwitamka takat unuimamu chichamjak nuwigtu achika najankuish imatilsail íkam awa imanuk atí tamaunum.
Ujukeg, ijujattajishkam titigdaujai betekmamtinuyi, duwi aentsun iju cinco nantui waitkasti tusa senchimtikamuyi.
