Nuna nugkuja aak pegkegmanum waya, tikich tesaamu shiig pegkegma nuna iwajug pegkeg awajsattawai. Dutikak altarnashkam iwajug pegkeg awajsattawai. Sacerdote dutikatta nunú dita pegkegchau takamsamujinak, tuja ashí Israel aents aidau pegkegchau takamsamujinashkam tsagkugnajagtatui.
